        <mxCell id="rjWUCo2-bhL27LLFIk7v-3" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;step 3.2&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. Creates a Protection Domain&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. registers a memeroy region = BUFFER_SIZE and configures it with LOCAL_WRITE and REMOTE_READ. Becuse we are going to read LLAMA weight from server to this MR&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="95" width="290" height="145" as="geometry" />
