        <mxCell id="rjWUCo2-bhL27LLFIk7v-11" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;step 3.3&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Creates a Completion Queue with capacity 10. The CQ is used for the NIC to write &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;CQE&lt;/b&gt;&#39;s to leet the CPU know when WR&#39;s are done.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;CQ is a shared buffer betwwen the NIC and CPI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
